#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "We've all had this dream"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "We all sort of remember"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "Some reach for it still, while others choose to surrender"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid ""
"You know, the one with all of the feelings you wish you knew how to describe?"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "The one you think about all the time"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "It feels similar and so afflicting, i know it, believe"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "You can't go a day without choking away the need to grieve"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "A memory you can almost recall"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "A faint feeling you had last fall"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "Nearly on the tip of your tongue, it spins"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "You just need to catch it before the other unbearable loop begins"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "It's a slippery slope going to the edge of your imagination"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "But it's so worth it, you betcha"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "Feeling pride for the ride you had to endure"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "The presence of life well lived right as you go through that door"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "The memories come rushing in for a hug"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "You feel like the rest was just a myth or a strange system bug"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "Finally, feel you're home for the long run"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/pages/arg4ntum-weve-all-had-this-dream/index.en.md
msgid "Knowing that you fully belong now."
msgstr ""

