#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/pages/contribute/index.en.md
msgid "Shows a vision of a better world acknowledging Climate Change"
msgstr "eine Vision einer besseren Welt zeigt, die den Klimawandel eingesteht,"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/pages/contribute/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Is set in a near-future with no \"magical\" technologies, whether powered by "
"nanorobots or dragon blood"
msgstr ""
"in der nahen Zukunft handelt, ohne \"magische\" Technologien wie Nanoroboter "
"oder Drachenblut, und"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
